# ⭐ OPIc Sample Answer - Day30

From my perspective, technology has definitely made people's lives better.

The main reason is that it makes many everyday tasks more convenient.

For example, we can use smartphones to communicate with people, find information, and manage our schedules.

Another reason is that technology gives us easier access to education.

For example, I can watch online lectures and study whenever I have free time.

Of course, there are some disadvantages, such as spending too much time on our phones.

However, I think the advantages are greater than the disadvantages.

That's why I think technology has had a positive impact on our lives.
